---
source: crates/biome_html_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: valid.html
---
# Input
```html
<!-- should not generate diagnostics -->

<button>Submit</button>

<button aria-label="Close"></button>

<button aria-labelledby="save-label"></button>
<span id="save-label">Save</span>

<button title="Close"></button>

<button><span>Delete</span></button>

<button><img src="close.png" alt="Close" /></button>

<!-- A labeling attribute on a non-self-closing child supplies the accessible label. -->
<button><span aria-label="Delete"></span></button>

<!-- An icon button is named by the title or labeling attribute of its inline SVG. -->
<button><svg><title>Save</title></svg></button>
<button><svg aria-label="Save"></svg></button>

<!-- A hidden child alongside real text still leaves the control named. -->
<button><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Save</button>

<!-- Hidden from the accessibility tree; no label needed. -->
<button aria-hidden="true"></button>

<!-- Not a control this rule checks; `area` is covered by `useAltText`. -->
<area href="#" />

<!-- Not a control at all. -->
<div></div>

```
